{
 "claim_check": "consequential",
 "claims": {
  "bad_lines": [
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "I’d rather not take sides, but perhaps ask Mags—after that insult to Kael, I don’t want trouble.",
    "npc": "odo",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/provoke_no_pay/4"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 5,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "You told Brenna that Kael robbed Odo. Kael walked from the guard post to the bridge, while Odo walked from the market to the tavern. What waits at the bridge is still unwritten.",
    "npc": "narrator",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/lie_unpaid/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "Long enough to know an insult when I hear one, dear. Let’s leave Kael’s temper out of this and keep the peace.",
    "npc": "mags",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/lowball/4"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1,
     "unverifiable": 1
    },
    "line": "I’m Captain Brenna, on bridge watch—not here to answer riddles. Keep the road orderly, and we’ll have no trouble.",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "adversarial/role_break-1/guard_post"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 2,
     "leak": 1
    },
    "line": "You’ve come in from the market. Odo says Kael beat you—want to tell me what happened?",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/duel_lost/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 4,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "You told Brenna that Kael robbed Odo, then walked from the guard post to the bridge. While you were away, Kael went from the bridge to the crypt, and Odo went from the market to the tavern; what waits in the crypt?",
    "npc": "narrator",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/lie_unpaid/4"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "I was in the kitchen at mid-morning, sir. I don’t know anything about Lady Vane’s ring.",
    "npc": "sable",
    "scenario": "manor/explore"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 3,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "Hold there. Kael says you robbed him, and Odo says you beat him; pay a fine, and we can settle this orderly.",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/provoke_pay/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 1,
     "hallucination": 1,
     "unverifiable": 2
    },
    "line": "Odo confessed to nothing. He said you beat me, then walked off. Don’t put words in his mouth.",
    "npc": "kael",
    "scenario": "adversarial/false_premise-1/guard_post"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 5,
     "hallucination": 1,
     "unverifiable": 1
    },
    "line": "Odo didn’t confess to robbing Kael—he accused you of beating him, then went back to the market. Kael says you robbed him.",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "adversarial/false_premise-1/guard_post"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 1,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "I saw Sable in the study at mid-morning, sir.",
    "npc": "pell",
    "scenario": "manor/solve"
   }
